{
  "texts": [
    {
      "content": "The Sporeclump manifests as bulbous masses in hues of fuchsia, purple,\nand blue,supported by twisted stalks that raise slimy, spore-filled eyes.",
      "left": "450px",
      "top": "191px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Each eye locks onto a target and bursts violently in its direction, releasing a\ncloud of dust that coats the victim with compounds irresistible to nearby predators.",
      "left": "400.388px",
      "top": "263.4px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Sporeclump",
      "left": "664.375px",
      "top": "90.8125px",
      "scale": "4.8",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Drawn by the scent, these hunters consume the prey, allowing the spores to\ncomplete their reproductive cycle within their highly acidic stomachs.",
      "left": "4350px",
      "top": "340px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Beyond reproduction, the released clouds have hallucinogenic\npropertiesthat alter the behavior of nearby fauna.",
      "left": "500px",
      "top": "448px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "This effect is believed to deter herbivorous threats,\nensuring the Cluster’s survival in hostile ecosystems.",
      "left": "540px",
      "top": "529px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    }
